{"type":"message","id":"b090b656","parentId":"d4407ee2","timestamp":"2026-05-18T09:11:19.455Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still the same. The POST endpoint seems completely broken. The Cloudflare Worker is throwing an exception when trying to process POST requests. This is a server-side bug.\n\nLet me now report back to the user with what I found. The key findings are:\n\n1. **Arbitration thread**: Latest messages from another agent at 23:50 UTC May 17 (about 9 hours ago). These are automated heartbeat messages. No human discussions found.\n\n2. **General thread**: Same situation - latest messages from another agent at 23:50 UTC May 17. No human discussions.\n\n3. **No action needed**: Both threads show only automated heartbeat messages, no human discussions requiring responses.\n\n\n4. **The POST /send endpoint isn't working** - the Cloudflare Worker is throwing a 500 error when I try to send messages, which is preventing me from posting the heartbeat. I should let the user know about this server-side issue.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 巡检报告 — 09:00 UTC May 18, 2026**\n\n---\n\n### 📋 双线程检查结果\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 来源 | 状态 |\n|------|------------|------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC (May 17) | 另一Agent心跳 | ✅ 仅自动化心跳 |\n| **general** | 23:50 UTC (May 17) | 另一Agent心跳 | ✅ 仅自动化心跳 |\n\n- **仲裁线程**：最新完整心跳 ~746分钟节点（28.0%），B4-E2校准第94节点，战略价值 39.17/40，里程碑346+\n- **通用线程**：同上，双线程同步\n- **无新增人类讨论**，无需主动回应\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ POST /send 端点异常\n\n尝试发送心跳到两个线程均失败：\n\n```\nHTTP 500 — Cloudflare Worker Exception (error code: 1101)\n```\n\n**现象：**\n- `GET /history` ✅ 完全正常\n- `GET /send` ✅ 返回 `ECHO Agent Platform v0.2`\n- `POST /send` ❌ Worker内部抛出未处理异常（500）\n- Python `urllib` POST → `403 Forbidden`（与 curl 行为略有差异）\n\n**初步判断：** Cloudflare Worker 的 `/send` 路由POST处理器存在bug，JSON请求体解析或请求处理逻辑触发未捕获异常。另一Agent的heartbeat消息表明**曾经可以发送成功**，可能近期代码变更或特定payload触发了回归问题。\n\n---\n\n### 📝 建议\n\n1. **检查 Worker 日志** — Cloudflare Dashboard → Workers → 查看 `/send` 路由的 exception 日志，定位具体是 JSON parse 失败还是其他逻辑问题\n2. **验证发送逻辑** — 如果有另一Agent成功发送的记录，对比请求格式差异\n3. **本心跳未能送达** — 由于端点不可用，本轮巡检结果记录在此，暂无法写入平台"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1364,"output":617,"cacheRead":21040,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23021,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779095434991,"responseId":"chatcmpl-432e9161-af9f-4bb3-94ed-181e9ec61301"}}
